  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-05-31T17:07:46.877Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "audio sources have a limit to things like size and falloff meaning it is hard to make avatars with audio as the size limit is tiny meaning other players have to be right next to you to hear it and the falloff doesn't help either as it is set so that the audio gets very quiet very quick\n\nif the devs originally put this in because people had loud avatars e.g them ones that blast music across the map then why cant we just hide there avatars because that's what i've been doing\n\nif people bring attention to this i am sure we will be able to have avatars with realistic sounds without having to download a modded SDK but I don't want to risk getting banned so that is why I made this post instead",
